WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:15.666
Hold for Dawn | Normal
Two garrisoned bridges defend the evacuation outpost

00:01:15.666 --> 00:01:35.885
Distress call | Northeast road
The stranded squad holds its position until friendly infantry arrive

00:01:35.885 --> 00:01:44.244
Expedition | Northeast road
Riflemen and Triage Specialists leave the garrison to reach the call

00:01:44.244 --> 00:03:01.479
Militia rescued | 1 of 3
The militia joins the army and has six game seconds of cover to pull back

00:03:01.479 --> 00:03:05.541
Distress call | Lowland ruins
The stranded squad holds its position until friendly infantry arrive

00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:13.932
Expedition | Lowland ruins
Riflemen and Triage Specialists leave the garrison to reach the call

00:03:13.932 --> 00:04:16.000
Militia rescued | 2 of 3
The militia joins the army and has six game seconds of cover to pull back

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:28.000
Bridge patrols
Two Riflemen on each crossing give the outpost sight across the river.

00:05:30.807 --> 00:05:35.276
Distress call | Western road
The stranded squad holds its position until friendly infantry arrive

00:05:35.276 --> 00:05:45.323
Expedition | Western road
Riflemen and Triage Specialists leave the garrison to reach the call

00:05:45.323 --> 00:08:03.354
Militia rescued | 3 of 3
The militia joins the army and has six game seconds of cover to pull back

00:08:03.354 --> 00:10:02.791
Final assault
Brood flyers and late ground waves close in on the outpost

00:10:02.791 --> 00:10:04.463
Rampart inbound
Keep the southeast landing pad clear

00:10:04.463 --> 00:10:05.782
Evacuation complete
The rescue ship reached the landing zone.
